  (text "ENTRADA / EFUSE\nJ_PWR_IN 1757242 → D_IN_TVS SMBJ15A-TR + C_IN_HF 100nF → U_EFUSE TPS259470ARPWR.\nUV/OV ladder: 12V_IN_RAW → R_UVOV_R1 470k → EN/UVLO → R_UVOV_R2 11k → OVLO → R_UVOV_R3 47k → GND.\nR_EFUSE_ILIM=750R; C_EFUSE_DVDT=3.3nF; C_EFUSE_ITIMER=2.2nF. AUXOFF/FLT NC.\nC_IN_BULK=100uF/25V en 12V_PROTECTED.\nFootprint PR13: NFB:TI_RPW0010A_TPS259470A."
